{\b LEGACY-X Checker}\par
\par
LEGACY-X staff asked you to run this check. Please read what it does before you install it.\par
\par
{\b What it looks at}\par
\bullet  Steam accounts on this PC: IDs, names, last login, when CS2 was last played, ban status and launch options.\par
\bullet  The programs on your drives: what each unsigned one does, for signs of a game cheat.\par
\bullet  The download list of your browsers (file name and the site it came from), not the pages you visited.\par
\bullet  Programs that are running, and traces of recently run programs.\par
\par
{\b What it sends}\par
\bullet  Names, masked paths and the findings only. Your files' contents are never sent.\par
\bullet  Only to LEGACY-X staff, one time, with the code you were given.\par
\par
{\b What happens afterwards}\par
\bullet  The result is also saved on your Desktop.\par
\bullet  The program removes itself from this PC once the result is sent.\par
\par
Click "I accept" to install. If you do not agree, close this window: nothing is installed or sent.\par
